======================================================================
Recommended Minimum Configuration for systems with < 640K memory
----------------------------------------------------------------------
        - IBM PC/XT using DOS version 3.0 or later.
        - 1.2MB/5.25 or 720KB/3.5 floppy drive for software installation.
        - Available memory for PALASM 4 >512 Kilobytes.
        - Available Hard disk space for PALASM 4 >10 Megabytes.
        - Monochrone monitor           (for use without OrCAD interface).
optional:
        - CGA compatible color monitor (for use with OrCAD/SDT option).
        - Mouse                        (for use with OrCAD/SDT option).
        - HP Laserjet series II/III or IBM Pro-Printer.

======================================================================
Recommended Minimum Configuration for systems using extended memory
----------------------------------------------------------------------
        - IBM AT/286 using DOS version 3.0 or later.
        - 1.2MB/5.25 or 720KB/3.5 floppy drive for software installation.
        - Available extended memory for PALASM 4 >1 Megabyte.
        - Available Hard disk space for PALASM 4 >10 Megabytes.
        - Monochrone monitor           (for use without OrCAD interface).
optional:
        - we recommend use with a standard Extended Memory Manager
          for example:       1.  QEMM  (Quarterdeck Extended Memory Manager)
                             2.  386 to the MAX (PC 386 only)

        - CGA compatible color monitor (for use with OrCAD/SDT option).
        - Mouse                        (for use with OrCAD/SDT option).
        - HP Laserjet series II/III or IBM Pro-Printer.

